{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23344","headline":"吴中好风景二首 二 · 白居易","name":"吴中好风景二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴中好风景，风景无朝暮。\n晓色万家烟，秋声八月树。\n舟移管弦动，桥拥旌旗驻。\n改号齐云楼，重开武丘路。\n况当丰岁熟，好是欢游处。\n州民劝使君，且莫抛官去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}